    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "某日石猴与松鼠坐在大青树上乘凉，石猴开口问“我是谁”，松鼠答“你是石头啊”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 51,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000051.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000051",
          "chapter_order": 51,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我是谁？”这一天他们坐在大青树上乘凉，石头说"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "石猴问“我不是一只猴子么”，松鼠回答“是啊”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 51,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000051.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000051",
          "chapter_order": 51,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我不是一只猴子么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "松鼠说她只知道世界上有很多松鼠但都不是自己，猴子的事她不清楚。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0112/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0112"
      },
      "revealed_at": 51,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000051.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000051",
          "chapter_order": 51,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我只知道这世界上有很多松鼠，但他们都不是我"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "石猴说自己与别的猴子不一样：他虽然是石头里出来的，可还是一只猴子；和他们在一起就不记得自己，常莫名停下来发现他们在跑而自己不动，就感到恐惧。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0067/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0067"
      },
      "revealed_at": 51,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000051.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000051",
          "chapter_order": 51,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "因为我和他们不一样。我虽然是石头里出来的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "石猴自述：他与别的猴子“不一样”，因此不与他们一起玩；和他们在一起他会不记得自己，且别人跑动而自己不动时他会恐惧。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0067/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0067"
      },
      "revealed_at": 51,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000051.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000051",
          "chapter_order": 51,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "和他们在一起，我就不记得自己了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [
        {
          "local_id": "claim-local-4"
        }
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "松鼠说她曾想做青树下那朵花、想做一只鹿，都没能成，目前也只有做松鼠。",
      "certainty": "reported",
